      "receiptSource": "The original source of this receipt isn\u0027t known. Can you help? \u003Ca href=\u0022mailto:editor@foodsofengland.co.uk?subject=Foods%20of%20England,%20Lincolnshire%20Haslet\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003Eeditor@foodsofengland.co.uk\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ELincolnshire Haslet\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u00BD lb coarse chopped belly pork\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u00BD lb coarse chopped pig liver\u003Cbr\u003E\n1/4 lb stale breadcrumbs, soaked\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 medium onion, minced\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 egg, beaten\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 tsp dried sage\u003Cbr\u003E\n1 tsp mixed herbs\u003Cbr\u003E\n1/4 tsp ground nutmeg\u003Cbr\u003E\nsalt\u003Cbr\u003E\nblack pepper\u003Cbr\u003E\ncaul fat to wrap\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nMix the ingredients and fill into a loaf tin lined with caul. Bake at 170C for 1 hour of until deep brown on top. Allow to cool in the tin. Cool and slice thinly to serve.\u003Cbr\u003E"
    }
